lavender: GPU pool buffers as parts of their chunk's descriptor (lock-screen hang with gpu=1)

- TopazAdreno.cpp: each 64 MB chunk keeps its descriptor; topaz_gpu_pool_md() gives an IOSubMemoryDescriptor of it,
  so letting a buffer go no longer destroys a device pager (backboardd waited in vm_object_destroy)
- idea from the first lavender project (its 1021); made by xnu/src/mk_pool.py

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp
